  "scope": "OpenSwathWorkflow.h and its translation unit come from the Core SDK pin; the TOPP tool (OpenSwathWorkflow.cpp of the openswath package) and the retained inputs and outputs come from the openswath and test-data packages, which are versioned independently of the Core SDK. The tool is not part of this crate: the test harness plays its role.",
  "method": "The invocations of TOPP_OpenSwathWorkflow_1, _3, _6, _18, _19, _20, _22, _23 and _threads4 are reproduced against OpenSwathWorkflow::perform_extraction on the retained inputs, with the parameters assembled as the tool does (Scoring subsection defaults and overrides, extraction parameters, MS1 and ion mobility options), and the features and chromatograms compared decoded with the FuzzyDiff.ini tolerances (ratio 1.01, absdiff 0.01) and the id= whitelist of the upstream DIFF.",
  "evidence_tier": "executed differential (tier 1), against retained C++ tool output",
